OL,3,GNEWSACarol Vorderman 'humbled and
OL,4,Aexcited' for Bafta Cymru honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresenter Carol Vorderman says she
OL,7,Ffeels humbled and excited to receive an
OL,8,Faward for outstanding contribution at
OL,9,Fthis year's Bafta Cymru, celebrating
OL,10,Fexcellence in film, TV and games.
OL,12,FVorderman is set to be presented with
OL,13,Fthe Sian Phillips Award while Lauren
OL,14,FEvans is taking home an award for her
OL,15,Fcontribution to the film I Swear, which
OL,16,Fcemented her reputation as one of the
OL,17,Fleading casting directors in Britain.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
