OL,3,GNEWSACarol Vorderman 'humbled and
OL,4,Aexcited' for Bafta Cymru honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee Walters, Bafta Cymru chair, said
OL,7,Fthe two women have taken "very
OL,8,Fdifferent paths", but have both
OL,9,F"achieved so much and thoroughly
OL,10,Fdeserve to be celebrated".
OL,12,FThe awards will be presented at the ICC
OL,13,FWales, in Newport, where Bafta Cymru
OL,14,Fhas been held since 2024.
